Cell["\<\
Now we have just seen that the hard wall is around 2, let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
repeat the process with more precision around  2.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9854046552622223`*^9, 3.9854046891685314`*^9}, {
   3.9854047720432167`*^9, 3.985404781302759*^9}, {3.9854062783792057`*^9, 
